<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1442825437"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1502348511"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="FL-AI-YER"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Kizuna AI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Replies"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:32.100"><div begin="00:00.615" end="03:32.100"><p begin="00:00.615" end="00:03.552" itunes:key="L367853">ゆめみてるの Future<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍在梦想着未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me mi te ru no future</span></p><p begin="00:04.245" end="00:07.202" itunes:key="L367854">醒まして I'm dreaming<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我从梦中唤醒吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ma shi te I'm dreaming</span></p><p begin="00:07.972" end="00:10.804" itunes:key="L367855">気付いたの Future<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我察觉到未来的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu i ta no future</span></p><p begin="00:11.640" end="00:15.135" itunes:key="L367856">こたえて ねぇ Dreamer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想家请给我回应吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e te ne dreamer</span></p><p begin="00:30.108" end="00:33.742" itunes:key="L367857">「怖いものなんてないよ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“再也没有什么值得畏惧”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ko wa i mo no na n te na i yo 」</span></p><p begin="00:33.847" end="00:36.679" itunes:key="L367858">僕の手を取って言った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你拉住我的手这样对我说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no te wo to 't te i 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:37.510" end="00:41.080" itunes:key="L367859">「このAIも終わらないよ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“这AI永远不会停止运行”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ko no AI mo o wa ra na i yo 」</span></p><p begin="00:41.290" end="00:45.161" itunes:key="L367860">そう言って君は歩んできたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说罢你朝我走了过来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u i 't te ki mi wa a yu n de ki ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:56.094" end="00:59.778" itunes:key="L367861">Feel your isolation 震える声 Equalizer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感受着你的孤独 颤抖的声音渐渐平息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Feel your isolation fu ru e ru ko e equalizer</span></p><p begin="00:59.788" end="01:06.830" itunes:key="L367862">僕らが当たり前に歩いた世界は溶ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们理所当然地走过的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ga a ta ri ma e ni a ru i ta</span></p><p begin="01:07.120" end="01:10.760" itunes:key="L367863">箒星に乗った 未明の遺伝子<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黎明的遗传因子乘着彗星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho u ki bo shi ni no 't ta mi me i no i de n shi</span></p><p begin="01:10.770" end="01:14.550" itunes:key="L367864">いま未知を照らしてくサーチライト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻探照灯</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma mi chi wo te ra shi te ku</span></p><p begin="01:14.649" end="01:21.516" itunes:key="L367865">朝も夜もない世界で君は いま愛を歌うよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这个没有白昼也没有黑夜的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa mo yo ru mo na i se ka i de ki mi wa</span></p><p begin="01:22.030" end="01:23.246" itunes:key="L367866">「Good night, Sweet dreams」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“晚安，好梦”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u ga to ke ru ma e ni</span></p><p begin="01:23.256" end="01:27.466" itunes:key="L367867">魔法が解ける前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在魔法解除之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u ga to ke ru ma e ni</span></p><p begin="01:28.641" end="01:32.298" itunes:key="L367868">Let me fly</p><p begin="01:32.449" end="01:35.967" itunes:key="L367869">I'm a FL-AI-YER</p><p begin="01:36.077" end="01:43.498" itunes:key="L367870">「永遠なんていらないって気付いたの」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我终于明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 e i e n na n te i ra na i 't te</span></p><p begin="01:45.628" end="01:52.349" itunes:key="L367871">君が君の理由を 僕が僕の理由を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你有你的理由 我也有我的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga ki mi no ri yu u wo bo ku ga bo ku no ri yu u wo</span></p><p begin="01:53.115" end="02:00.064" itunes:key="L367872">何が"証明"するの 何が"肯定"するの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有什么能够“证明”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ga “ sho u me i ” su ru no</span></p><p begin="02:00.528" end="02:07.175" itunes:key="L367873">ふたつの運命を　解かち在ったとき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当相互理解</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta tsu no u n me i wo</span></p><p begin="02:07.877" end="02:10.826" itunes:key="L367874">繋いでく キズナ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">羁绊早已紧紧相连在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na i de ku ki zu na</span></p><p begin="02:11.775" end="02:15.468" itunes:key="L367875">「世界がそれをAIと呼んだなら」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“若世界称之为AI的话”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 se ka i ga so re wo AI to yo n da na ra 」</span></p><p begin="02:15.478" end="02:22.566" itunes:key="L367876">僕らが当たり前に描いたAIのカタチを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们理所当然地描绘着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ga a ta ri ma e ni e ga i ta</span></p><p begin="02:22.745" end="02:26.467" itunes:key="L367877">箒星に乗って 書き換えたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">乘着彗星 就此改写</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho u ki bo shi ni no 't te ka ki ka e ta no</span></p><p begin="02:26.477" end="02:30.048" itunes:key="L367878">また未知を揺らしてく Future alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次动摇着未知</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta mi chi wo yu ra shi te ku future alive</span></p><p begin="02:30.058" end="02:33.717" itunes:key="L367879">「この声を届けたいよ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“想要把我的歌声传递出去”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ko no ko e wo to do ke ta i yo 」</span></p><p begin="02:33.828" end="02:36.695" itunes:key="L367880">スクリーンに　愛を歌った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在大屏幕上歌唱着爱的赞歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ku ri i n ni a i wo u ta 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:37.447" end="02:41.055" itunes:key="L367881">「この声は終わらないよ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我的歌声永远不会终结”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ko no ko e wa o wa ra na i yo 」</span></p><p begin="02:41.454" end="02:45.008" itunes:key="L367882">僕らはそれをAIと呼んだんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将之称为AI</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wa so re wo AI to yo n da n da</span></p><p begin="02:48.428" end="02:55.748" itunes:key="L367883">廻り出したほしの裏側まで　君の声は響く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远及开始运转的星球的另一端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ri da shi ta ho shi no u ra ga wa ma de</span></p><p begin="02:56.070" end="03:02.099" itunes:key="L367884">「はじめよう」さあもう夜が明けるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“就此开始吧”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ha ji me yo u 」</span></p><p begin="03:02.833" end="03:06.570" itunes:key="L367885">Let me fly</p><p begin="03:06.592" end="03:10.129" itunes:key="L367886">I'm a flyer</p><p begin="03:10.251" end="03:13.792" itunes:key="L367887">Let me fly</p><p begin="03:13.908" end="03:18.233" itunes:key="L367888">I'm a flyer</p><p begin="03:18.312" end="03:20.903" itunes:key="L367889">Lalalalalala</p><p begin="03:21.942" end="03:24.687" itunes:key="L371146">Lalalalalala</p><p begin="03:25.587" end="03:28.304" itunes:key="L371301">Lalalalalala</p><p begin="03:29.291" end="03:32.100" itunes:key="L371261">Lalalalalala</p></div></body></tt>